mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[Integration need] --> Q1{User must see the remote result now?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| UI[UI or Flow plus Apex callout request/reply; timeout up to 120s]
  Q1 -->|No| Q2{Guaranteed hand-off from Salesforce?}
  Q2 -->|Yes consider| OM[Outbound messaging or equivalent ack pattern]
  Q2 -->|Event bus| PE[Platform events; subscriber retries; 72-hour replay]
  UI --> Q3{Entry is a trigger save?}
  Q3 -->|Sync HTTP attempted| Stop[Suboptimal/invalid for request/reply; go async or UI-initiated]
  Any[Any pattern] --> Fail[Design error handling, recovery, idempotency before go-live]
  Chatty[Continuous two-way updates] --> Avoid[Suboptimal chatty remote call-in / invocation]
